    "searchText": "hunt some heads headhunters_patrol_nyx_super headhunters careercontract ship combat mercenary pickup: generated from nyx pool got some asshole’s trying to push us out of the system. you up for pushing back?\n\nsee, there are some folks who really don’t want us here, and have started sending out hunting parties of five to seven ships, often with a bigger gun ship, to places where we’re building up our presence. time for us to show that we’re here to stay.  \n\ni’ve strung together a few spots starting at the location marker on your hud where we’re seeing the most hostile encounters. need you to visit each one and scan to see if we can bait them into a fight.\n\nknow this is going to be a hard one, so don't be cocky and try to go it alone. if i were you, i'd bring at least three friends onboard for support. to make it worth your while, i'm promising a bonus of [scripamount] council scrip to the main contractor that pulls it off. \n\n- stows looking for trouble scout and scan see what’s out there space patrol stand our ground 995895a5-d686-468a-a592-b0fa86d7bffb abbbeee2-38ab-49b9-808f-0836de89a086 c980057a-d5da-4c8e-8f12-1d53394d4d35 e6a1a6e9-f890-4ec0-a8a8-7cc70e1262c9 3e2038ff-3ee3-4887-aa8a-9c7fd865c4fe eb9a15b4-37d1-452b-8a64-3ec9d4ba13e7 7f1e662e-4827-4330-a9b9-2cc1b8a3f2c1 904f0ea3-d298-49cf-aaea-01301ef17e96 b01b5254-7c99-4273-a67a-3b2432b9b6dc cae40678-d171-4f2d-bf1f-45c94314214e 55057858-d185-4b9e-b78e-95bc53b5c641 b9f66d6b-e4d8-40a0-89ce-ab7044e16001 ship combat +300 credits formula unresolved item reward: council scrip ship combat +200 ship combat +100 ship combat +150 ship combat +250"
